WEBVTT

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:06.770
What? Don't kill the goddesses?

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:13.340
Well, I guess, there's only one day left...

00:00:13.770 --> 00:00:15.410
Whatever happens, you can't blame me.

00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:21.760
The people at the top are so greedy...

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:25.990
Well, I've done enough work 
for the rest of my life.

00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:29.130
Once Hell is restored, I can live in comfort.

00:02:07.820 --> 00:02:09.140
<i>I'm on my way over</i>

00:02:09.140 --> 00:02:10.150
<i>to confess my love!</i>

00:02:11.190 --> 00:02:14.150
<i>What is Katsuragi thinking?</i>

00:02:17.030 --> 00:02:19.320
Damn, which one is Ayumi's room?

00:02:21.210 --> 00:02:22.170
Katsuragi?

00:02:25.870 --> 00:02:26.660
Katsura—

00:02:27.650 --> 00:02:28.750
What are you doing?

00:02:29.230 --> 00:02:30.750
A-Ayumi?

00:02:31.390 --> 00:02:33.330
Why are you taking a bath?

00:02:33.330 --> 00:02:34.750
I said I was coming to see you.

00:02:35.140 --> 00:02:37.700
I didn't think you'd actually come!

00:02:35.140 --> 00:02:39.100
Why do I have to follow you people around?

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:39.170
I never lie!

00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:41.260
Right now, we can't leave you alone.

00:02:39.170 --> 00:02:41.260
You've already lied to me!

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:44.010
Take that, you sick, peeping pervert! Leave!

00:02:44.350 --> 00:02:46.770
I'm not leaving... 
I have to tell you something.

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:48.640
So what?

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:50.770
I don't get what you're trying to do!

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:53.810
I d-don't get it, either!

00:02:54.520 --> 00:02:56.650
I never wanted anything to 
do with the real world.

00:03:00.750 --> 00:03:02.110
P-Panties?!

00:03:02.750 --> 00:03:04.510
Those are mine!

00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:12.210
S-Stay calm.

00:03:14.990 --> 00:03:17.070
And who exactly got those from her?

00:03:17.070 --> 00:03:18.030
I did.

00:03:18.640 --> 00:03:21.120
That boy's got a sick way of handling things.

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:22.180
I like it.

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:24.720
Idiot! Scumbag! Criminal!

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:26.820
Die! Die! Die! Die! Die!

00:03:27.760 --> 00:03:29.060
Ayumi, hear me out!

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:34.200
I've been watching you from the beginning.

00:03:34.950 --> 00:03:37.110
I'm sorry I never said anything.

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:39.150
But my feelings haven't changed!

00:03:40.230 --> 00:03:41.480
The one I most care for is...

00:03:42.460 --> 00:03:45.250
<i>Wh-What the hell?!</i>

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:46.080
Ayumi!

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:48.400
Come to the Turtle Stones, 
on the Kozue River.

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:49.450
I'll be waiting!

00:03:50.390 --> 00:03:51.870
If you don't come,

00:03:52.350 --> 00:03:53.620
I won't return your panties.

00:03:55.330 --> 00:03:57.680
Stupid! Give them back!

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:12.390
<i>This place has an excellent view 
and the right atmosphere.</i>

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:14.980
<i>I even gave her the pretext of 
coming to get her panties back.</i>

00:04:15.780 --> 00:04:17.300
<i>You have to come, Ayumi...</i>

00:04:17.700 --> 00:04:18.730
Katsuragi!

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:22.490
Vintage will execute their plan tomorrow.

00:04:23.020 --> 00:04:25.990
If you don't conquer Ayumi 
tonight, it'll be too late.

00:04:27.810 --> 00:04:30.150
Ayumi's affection level is already high enough.

00:04:30.150 --> 00:04:33.870
Otherwise, she wouldn't have 
considered quitting the band.

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:37.880
I just need one more big event 
to complete the conquest.

00:04:38.360 --> 00:04:40.630
Wait... What is this conquest stuff?

00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:43.260
What's Katsuragi up to?!

00:04:45.620 --> 00:04:49.130
Huh? I thought my Exalted Brother called me...

00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:52.710
Kanon, it's almost time.

00:04:52.710 --> 00:04:54.020
Okay!

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:59.500
Right now, we need the power inside Ayumi.

00:04:59.850 --> 00:05:03.380
To draw it out, Ayumi has to fall in love.

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:05.870
What does love have to do with anything?

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:07.610
I feel sorry for Ayumi,

00:05:07.610 --> 00:05:09.530
but it's necessary to stop Vintage.

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:13.620
<i>Is she talking about the 
people who attacked us?</i>

00:05:15.100 --> 00:05:18.130
Only Katsuragi has the means 
to rectify the situation.

00:05:18.710 --> 00:05:21.660
That's why Katsuragi is putting 
the moves on Ayumi?

00:05:21.660 --> 00:05:24.000
What if Ayumi takes him seriously?

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:32.750
<i>Ayumi, you shouldn't have come...</i>

00:05:32.750 --> 00:05:34.140
<i>It's a trap!</i>

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:36.200
Katsuragi...

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:38.560
Ayumi, you really came to meet me?

00:05:39.070 --> 00:05:40.150
Hardly.

00:05:40.850 --> 00:05:44.140
I'm here to recover my underwear from a thief.

00:05:44.140 --> 00:05:44.880
Huh?

00:05:44.880 --> 00:05:47.120
These just happened to be lying on the ground...

00:05:47.930 --> 00:05:49.450
D-Don't take them out!

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:04.050
I a-almost fell in the water.

00:06:04.050 --> 00:06:05.920
S-Sorry.

00:06:06.710 --> 00:06:09.680
<i>Wh-What kind of pathetic acting was that?</i>

00:06:10.080 --> 00:06:12.760
I keep causing trouble for you.

00:06:13.440 --> 00:06:14.980
No kidding.

00:06:14.980 --> 00:06:17.350
You've been nothing but trouble!

00:06:17.630 --> 00:06:20.230
You're awful, Katsuragi...

00:06:21.530 --> 00:06:23.650
<i>Why did I even come?</i>

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:26.690
<i>Did something happen 
between Katsuragi and Ayumi?</i>

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:30.660
Nora?

00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:33.050
Vintage is heading your way.

00:06:33.850 --> 00:06:35.210
You should leave.

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:38.230
Katsuragi!

00:06:39.280 --> 00:06:40.770
Vintage is coming.

00:06:40.770 --> 00:06:41.630
Let's move.

00:06:41.630 --> 00:06:43.790
<i>Move? They couldn't wait five minutes?</i>

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:45.370
Ayumi...

00:06:45.370 --> 00:06:46.190
Huh?

00:06:46.190 --> 00:06:47.170
Let's go!

00:06:47.370 --> 00:06:48.940
There's a place I want to show you.

00:06:52.940 --> 00:06:54.430
I'm surprised...

00:06:54.710 --> 00:06:57.080
that you picked a park.

00:06:57.470 --> 00:06:59.440
I thought you never went outside as a kid.

00:06:59.840 --> 00:07:01.690
Even I went to the park sometimes.

00:07:02.410 --> 00:07:04.170
Slides and jungle gyms...

00:07:04.170 --> 00:07:05.660
Sandboxes and see-saws...

00:07:06.360 --> 00:07:07.690
I played my games in all of them.

00:07:08.350 --> 00:07:10.200
Is there even any point in that?

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:15.720
I'm glad I could come here with you.

00:07:17.070 --> 00:07:17.870
Why?

00:07:21.310 --> 00:07:22.220
Katsuragi...

00:07:22.220 --> 00:07:23.640
Vintage is here, too.

00:07:23.640 --> 00:07:24.840
Distract Ayumi.

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:28.710
Katsuragi!

00:07:33.420 --> 00:07:36.100
Hey, are you okay? Katsuragi?

00:07:36.450 --> 00:07:40.730
I was so busy thinking about what 
to say, I forgot I was on a swing.

00:07:41.900 --> 00:07:42.600
Stupid.

00:07:42.930 --> 00:07:44.700
I took care of it, Katsuragi.

00:07:44.700 --> 00:07:46.480
But this place is no longer safe.

00:07:46.890 --> 00:07:48.400
<i>Our next destination is Maijima Shrine.</i>

00:07:49.210 --> 00:07:50.350
Oh, Ayumi...

00:07:50.350 --> 00:07:51.440
There's go to one more place!

00:07:51.440 --> 00:07:52.970
What? Again?

00:07:52.970 --> 00:07:56.140
<i>Damn, I'm wasting good lines and locations.</i>

00:07:56.850 --> 00:07:58.830
Chihiro, we have to go.

00:07:59.220 --> 00:08:01.780
If Katsuragi fails, what will you do?

00:08:02.690 --> 00:08:03.700
Fails?

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:05.570
That isn't an option.

00:08:12.600 --> 00:08:14.120
We're still not there?

00:08:14.120 --> 00:08:15.960
C-Can we take a break?

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:21.530
Well, if you can't find them, 
you'll suffer the consequences...

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:26.310
Don't contact me again 
unless you've found a goddess.

00:08:29.920 --> 00:08:31.800
<i>She's one of them.</i>

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:34.820
Katsuragi, get away from there!

00:08:36.270 --> 00:08:37.230
Okay...

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:39.270
I'm rested up, so let's go!

00:08:39.270 --> 00:08:40.850
O-Okay...

00:08:49.370 --> 00:08:50.710
Hi.

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:52.950
I don't recognize you.

00:08:52.950 --> 00:08:54.220
Which district are you from?

00:09:04.690 --> 00:09:05.770
Katsuragi...

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:08.260
That girl was probably a Vintage member.

00:09:08.260 --> 00:09:09.690
Take shelter indoors.

00:09:10.280 --> 00:09:13.110
You want me to confess in a family 
restaurant or a karaoke box?

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:15.070
As a gamer, my pride won't allow it.

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:16.450
We need to go to Maijima Shrine.

00:09:17.130 --> 00:09:19.070
Why do you have to be so picky?

00:09:19.070 --> 00:09:21.200
The city is swarming with Vintage.

00:09:21.570 --> 00:09:25.270
Hey, someone I know lives up ahead.

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:27.460
<b>Maijima Happy Road</b>

00:09:27.820 --> 00:09:29.460
Keep going straight.

00:09:30.100 --> 00:09:31.560
<i>That was the plan.</i>

00:09:31.560 --> 00:09:33.550
Oh? You're downstairs?

00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:37.510
Miyako?

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:38.390
Huh?

00:09:39.030 --> 00:09:41.220
Ayumi? Katsuragi?

00:09:41.220 --> 00:09:42.970
Heya!

00:09:43.280 --> 00:09:46.370
I couldn't stop thinking about 
tomorrow's concert...

00:09:46.370 --> 00:09:47.850
So I dropped by.

00:09:48.260 --> 00:09:49.420
Chihiro?

00:09:49.420 --> 00:09:51.230
Whoa, it's the dweeb!

00:09:51.700 --> 00:09:53.140
Come on in.

00:09:53.140 --> 00:09:54.570
I'll get some drinks.

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:55.880
Give me a hand, Ayumi.

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:56.900
Sure.

00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:01.840
Chihiro suddenly called me...

00:10:01.840 --> 00:10:03.120
Oh, really?

00:10:03.840 --> 00:10:06.620
Hey, Chihiro. What are you up to?

00:10:07.640 --> 00:10:09.670
You need a place to hide, right?

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:11.720
Don't interfere!

00:10:12.600 --> 00:10:15.930
Five minutes... I only needed 
one event to finish the job.

00:10:15.930 --> 00:10:17.720
These detours aren't helping!

00:10:17.720 --> 00:10:20.410
Can you stop talking about 
this like it's a game?

00:10:20.410 --> 00:10:22.000
That's how I operate.

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:24.010
My first priority is to conquer the target!

00:10:26.380 --> 00:10:28.430
How long have you been targeting Ayumi?

00:10:29.570 --> 00:10:34.170
I heard that you approached Ayumi 
because you need her power.

00:10:35.300 --> 00:10:40.280
Sorry for confessing to you at the worst time.

00:10:43.420 --> 00:10:46.100
To make it up to you, I'll help you.

00:10:48.410 --> 00:10:49.690
<i>Help me?</i>

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:56.980
My school's currently having a cultural festival.

00:10:56.980 --> 00:11:00.140
Getting everyone to work together isn't easy,

00:11:00.140 --> 00:11:01.660
but it's a lot of fun!

00:11:02.740 --> 00:11:05.330
Time really flies, huh?

00:11:05.330 --> 00:11:07.490
Tomorrow's the big day!

00:11:07.490 --> 00:11:08.830
Y-Yeah.

00:11:09.960 --> 00:11:12.320
Ayumi, why were you with Katsuragi?

00:11:13.920 --> 00:11:15.210
I wasn't really with him...

00:11:15.210 --> 00:11:17.300
Oh, don't worry about it.

00:11:17.300 --> 00:11:18.730
It doesn't matter anymore.

00:11:20.770 --> 00:11:23.280
<i>Chihiro, don't turn things in that direction!</i>

00:11:23.810 --> 00:11:26.910
<i>You might be trying to let Ayumi have me,</i>

00:11:24.070 --> 00:11:26.440
Your glass is empty, Ayumi!

00:11:26.440 --> 00:11:28.260
Huh? O-Oh...

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:31.230
<i>but that will make Ayumi feel guilty, 
which will take more time to fix.</i>

00:11:28.530 --> 00:11:30.200
Here you go.

00:11:32.530 --> 00:11:34.750
<i>I'm not after the best ending right now.</i>

00:11:35.620 --> 00:11:37.120
<i>I'm doing a speed run!</i>

00:11:37.120 --> 00:11:38.670
Oh, that's right.

00:11:38.830 --> 00:11:40.880
Wanna try on our uniforms for tomorrow?

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:42.100
Definitely.

00:11:42.100 --> 00:11:42.930
Ditto.

00:11:43.830 --> 00:11:46.150
Here! This is Ayumi's.

00:11:47.280 --> 00:11:49.770
Okay, no boys allowed!

00:11:48.760 --> 00:11:49.770
Hey, wait!

00:11:50.620 --> 00:11:52.140
Hey! Let me in!

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:54.790
My next route was about to...

00:11:52.980 --> 00:11:55.270
Miyako, tell your friend to keep it down!

00:11:55.860 --> 00:11:57.400
Okay!

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:03.290
So, Ayumi...

00:12:03.750 --> 00:12:07.410
You're in love with Katsuragi, right?

00:12:07.740 --> 00:12:08.550
Huh?

00:12:08.550 --> 00:12:10.910
I-It isn't like that...

00:12:12.280 --> 00:12:14.190
<i>Of course not.</i>

00:12:16.170 --> 00:12:18.280
<i>I was just pulling one over on a real girl.</i>

00:12:19.070 --> 00:12:19.880
<i>Stupid.</i>

00:12:20.490 --> 00:12:22.300
<i>Stay away from me.</i>

00:12:25.920 --> 00:12:26.870
Ayumi...

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:28.390
Did you know this?

00:12:30.120 --> 00:12:32.520
Katsuragi is a liar.

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:32.790
Paused

00:12:32.790 --> 00:12:38.520
Playing

00:12:34.050 --> 00:12:37.500
Five minutes... I only needed 
one event to finish the job.

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:39.000
These detours aren't helping!

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:41.550
Can you stop talking about 
this like it's a game?

00:12:41.550 --> 00:12:42.990
That's how I operate.

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:45.030
My first priority is to conquer the target!

00:12:47.810 --> 00:12:50.900
Katsuragi's playing a game where 
the goal is to seduce you.

00:12:50.900 --> 00:12:53.120
Huh? But...

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:55.500
He wouldn't have caught you bathing 
without planning ahead.

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:56.960
How do you know about that?

00:12:56.960 --> 00:12:59.040
I was there the whole time.

00:12:59.690 --> 00:13:02.440
The stops at the river and 
park were part of his plan.

00:13:02.440 --> 00:13:05.050
He was confident about the whole thing.

00:13:05.480 --> 00:13:07.200
He's playing a game...

00:13:07.710 --> 00:13:10.310
A game with the goal of seducing you tonight!

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:12.230
Stop it.

00:13:14.470 --> 00:13:16.440
Chihiro, what are you doing?

00:13:16.720 --> 00:13:18.500
Tough luck...

00:13:18.500 --> 00:13:20.950
I just ruined your plans.

00:13:22.190 --> 00:13:23.330
Katsuragi,

00:13:23.330 --> 00:13:24.320
what is this about?

00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:25.700
This is...

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:27.450
He'll try to talk his way out of it.

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:28.820
That's how he works.

00:13:28.820 --> 00:13:30.420
You were lying to me?

00:13:30.420 --> 00:13:31.050
Wait...

00:13:31.050 --> 00:13:32.830
Did you return Ayumi's panties?

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:34.330
Didn't you steal them from her bathroom?

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:35.780
What's your problem?!

00:13:35.780 --> 00:13:38.300
What? I'm just telling it how it is.

00:13:38.300 --> 00:13:39.210
That isn't...

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:43.020
Only idiots would be fooled by this scumbag.

00:13:43.020 --> 00:13:44.090
Idiots like Ayumi...

00:13:45.400 --> 00:13:46.280
And me.

00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:54.350
Nora!

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:57.650
Grab her before Vintage finds her!

00:13:57.650 --> 00:13:58.770
Wait, Haqua...

00:13:59.110 --> 00:14:00.630
Don't let her find out yet.

00:14:01.300 --> 00:14:02.520
Guard her without letting her notice!

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:05.440
We're going after her.

00:14:05.880 --> 00:14:06.660
Hey...

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:10.450
Clean up before you leave!

00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:12.990
What are you thinking?

00:14:13.560 --> 00:14:16.520
If I can't conquer Ayumi, we're in big trouble.

00:14:16.520 --> 00:14:18.690
Then you should get serious about her.

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:21.710
I don't like how you're going about this.

00:14:22.360 --> 00:14:25.090
Ayumi is an honest person!

00:14:25.090 --> 00:14:27.720
So she's probably really confused right now.

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:30.840
Stop lying to her...

00:14:31.820 --> 00:14:35.350
If you want to win Ayumi's heart, 
you have to truly love her!

00:14:44.560 --> 00:14:46.420
Okay, I understand.

00:14:47.470 --> 00:14:49.500
So what's going on with you guys?

00:14:49.500 --> 00:14:51.850
Sorry, I'll explain later.

00:14:51.850 --> 00:14:53.080
Okay, I guess.

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:54.660
Let's kick some butt tomorrow.

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:55.670
Yeah!

00:14:55.670 --> 00:14:57.200
Haqua, I need a favor.

00:14:57.820 --> 00:15:01.760
Why do we forget our dreams 
as soon as we wake up?

00:15:01.760 --> 00:15:06.110
I feel like I just received 
an important phone call,

00:15:06.110 --> 00:15:08.720
but was it just a dream?

00:15:09.480 --> 00:15:12.340
I thought that we'd draw 
attention from the real Kanon

00:15:12.340 --> 00:15:14.850
by protecting Katsuragi's disguised sister.

00:15:15.260 --> 00:15:20.630
After we drove off Vintage, it seemed successful.

00:15:20.960 --> 00:15:23.670
But it appears they realized the 
truth at the last second.

00:15:23.670 --> 00:15:28.150
Most of the goddesses seem to 
have fallen into their hands.

00:15:28.660 --> 00:15:31.330
However, there's nothing we can do.

00:15:31.330 --> 00:15:33.530
Our only choice is to trust Katsuragi.

00:15:40.660 --> 00:15:41.780
Jeez...

00:15:41.780 --> 00:15:43.390
Why did you do that?

00:15:43.390 --> 00:15:45.270
He has to start the conquest all over!

00:15:46.190 --> 00:15:49.340
But I'm no longer a factor in Ayumi's mind.

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:49.920
Huh?

00:15:50.310 --> 00:15:53.540
Ayumi was worried about how I would feel.

00:15:54.140 --> 00:15:56.510
Now that I've removed myself 
from the picture,

00:15:56.510 --> 00:15:58.440
it's up to the two of them.

00:15:58.440 --> 00:16:01.790
You said that to destroy the love triangle?

00:16:02.300 --> 00:16:04.440
Katsuragi figured it out

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:07.940
because I didn't tell Ayumi about you guys.

00:16:08.930 --> 00:16:10.830
Ayumi will be fine...

00:16:10.830 --> 00:16:14.450
It isn't easy to hate someone 
you've fallen in love with.

00:16:14.800 --> 00:16:18.700
As long as he's honest with her, 
Ayumi will forgive Katsuragi.

00:16:19.900 --> 00:16:21.710
Anyway, I have a question.

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:24.980
Why did Katsuragi go on a date with me?

00:16:24.980 --> 00:16:26.080
Huh?

00:16:26.080 --> 00:16:28.700
Katsuragi was targeting Ayumi, right?

00:16:28.700 --> 00:16:31.220
Wouldn't going on a date with 
me be wasting his time?

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:32.730
That was because...

00:16:36.070 --> 00:16:38.850
<i>Has he been lying to me this entire time?</i>

00:16:39.340 --> 00:16:43.440
<i>Ever since that day before the tournament?</i>

00:16:48.330 --> 00:16:51.370
Welcome home, my princess.

00:16:57.210 --> 00:16:59.470
<i>How stupid can you be?!</i>

00:16:59.470 --> 00:17:02.160
<i>You should just apologize 
and confess your love...</i>

00:17:02.570 --> 00:17:04.220
The real world means nothing to me.

00:17:04.220 --> 00:17:06.170
I live in the ideal world.

00:17:06.780 --> 00:17:08.700
I refuse to pretend to be someone I'm not.

00:17:09.080 --> 00:17:10.740
So I won't apologize.

00:17:11.940 --> 00:17:14.950
I will only show you my perfect side.

00:17:15.570 --> 00:17:17.730
Come with me, Ayumi.

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:24.790
I understand how you feel now.

00:17:25.860 --> 00:17:27.810
So marry me!

00:17:30.270 --> 00:17:32.940
If you're serious, you should 
be willing to do that!

00:17:36.430 --> 00:17:39.060
Whatever you might say, I know you can't do it.

00:17:39.060 --> 00:17:40.550
You're all talk.

00:17:40.550 --> 00:17:41.270
Very well.

00:17:42.480 --> 00:17:43.330
Let's get married.

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:47.580
However, there are certain conditions.

00:17:48.030 --> 00:17:51.030
In games, marriage is the ultimate ending.

00:17:51.030 --> 00:17:53.090
It can't occur unless the criteria are met.

00:17:53.410 --> 00:17:55.690
At a minimum, the connection 
must have begun in childhood,

00:17:55.690 --> 00:17:57.990
there must be a dramatic proposal,

00:17:57.990 --> 00:18:02.140
and there must be a kiss in a church, 
with the words "Happy End" popping up!

00:18:02.400 --> 00:18:04.020
Can you accept those conditions?

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:07.330
It's impossible to do anything 
about our childhood!

00:18:07.330 --> 00:18:10.190
In other words, you're all talk.

00:18:11.240 --> 00:18:14.030
I take marriage much more seriously than you!

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:17.320
You shouldn't use the word 
"marriage" so lightly.

00:18:18.460 --> 00:18:20.340
Daddy! Mommy!

00:18:21.000 --> 00:18:22.440
Is this a friend?

00:18:22.440 --> 00:18:24.240
Do you realize what time it is?

00:18:24.630 --> 00:18:26.480
Daddy... Mommy...

00:18:26.480 --> 00:18:28.710
I'm going to be a bride.

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:32.350
This is my future husband.

00:18:33.680 --> 00:18:35.280
Ready to give up?

00:18:38.540 --> 00:18:40.150
All the better.

00:18:40.150 --> 00:18:43.530
I wanted to have your parents here for this.

00:18:47.770 --> 00:18:50.770
Sorry, but this is all I can give you for now.

00:18:53.870 --> 00:18:55.440
This is my present to you.

00:18:57.340 --> 00:18:58.950
A wedding dress?

00:18:59.610 --> 00:19:01.790
You are my first heroine,

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:03.950
and my final heroine.

00:19:04.630 --> 00:19:05.700
Will you marry me?

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:14.620
I don't get you, Katsuragi...

00:19:14.620 --> 00:19:18.470
You're a selfish womanizer who hates women...

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:19.880
Stupid and dumb,

00:19:19.880 --> 00:19:21.850
smart and sneaky,

00:19:21.850 --> 00:19:23.260
cold and gentle,

00:19:23.260 --> 00:19:25.270
kind and mean,

00:19:25.270 --> 00:19:26.810
dishonest and honest...

00:19:27.390 --> 00:19:29.630
But I trust you.

00:19:29.960 --> 00:19:30.810
So...

00:19:31.760 --> 00:19:32.810
Say you love me!

00:19:35.260 --> 00:19:37.750
If you say those words, I'll believe you.

00:19:38.290 --> 00:19:40.270
Do you love me?

00:19:40.270 --> 00:19:41.860
H-Hold on!

00:19:41.860 --> 00:19:42.820
Calm down, dear!

00:19:43.460 --> 00:19:44.350
Ayumi,

00:19:44.820 --> 00:19:45.700
I love you.

00:19:48.310 --> 00:19:49.340
Not good enough.

00:19:50.240 --> 00:19:51.630
That was fake.

00:19:51.630 --> 00:19:53.550
It wasn't sincere.

00:19:53.550 --> 00:19:55.900
You have to really mean it!

00:19:55.900 --> 00:19:56.500
I love you.

00:19:58.360 --> 00:19:59.880
You aren't allowed to touch me!

00:19:59.880 --> 00:20:01.010
That's against the rules!

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:03.020
I can't force you to believe me...

00:20:03.020 --> 00:20:04.850
But I'll keep on saying it.

00:20:05.690 --> 00:20:07.220
I love you.

00:20:08.170 --> 00:20:11.860
It sounds more and more like an act!

00:20:11.860 --> 00:20:13.610
Just say, "I love you."

00:20:13.610 --> 00:20:14.990
I love you.

00:20:14.990 --> 00:20:15.760
Not good enough!

00:20:15.760 --> 00:20:17.330
P.S. I love you.

00:20:17.330 --> 00:20:18.470
No good!

00:20:18.470 --> 00:20:20.090
How can you propose,

00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:20.090
This is stupid.

00:20:20.090 --> 00:20:20.870
I'm going to bed!

00:20:20.090 --> 00:20:21.760
when you can't even say you love me?

00:20:20.870 --> 00:20:21.740
So am I.

00:20:21.880 --> 00:20:22.480
<b>10 Minutes Later</b>

00:20:24.080 --> 00:20:25.870
How many times must I repeat it?

00:20:25.870 --> 00:20:27.240
I'm out of lines...

00:20:29.310 --> 00:20:31.870
I love you, Katsuragi!

00:20:33.610 --> 00:20:35.570
That was a sincere confession.

00:20:35.570 --> 00:20:36.610
Get it?

00:20:36.610 --> 00:20:38.030
It's your turn now!

00:20:38.810 --> 00:20:39.770
Ayumi?

00:20:40.740 --> 00:20:43.150
You want to get married 
somewhere romantic, right?

00:20:43.620 --> 00:20:45.570
I'll be waiting for you.

00:20:45.570 --> 00:20:46.300
Ayumi!

00:20:50.040 --> 00:20:51.770
Nora, she's moving again.

00:20:51.770 --> 00:20:52.780
Follow her!

00:20:52.780 --> 00:20:53.600
Roger that.

00:21:01.090 --> 00:21:02.070
Hide!

00:21:04.410 --> 00:21:05.660
Vintage...

00:21:05.660 --> 00:21:06.320
Nora!

00:21:08.300 --> 00:21:10.620
Nora wouldn't let herself be killed.

00:21:10.790 --> 00:21:13.240
You should be careful, or you'll die.

00:21:13.670 --> 00:21:14.800
You're...

00:21:14.800 --> 00:21:16.360
Nora's buddy.

00:21:17.760 --> 00:21:19.630
I'm following Nora's instructions.

00:21:20.140 --> 00:21:22.650
To interfere with Vintage's search,

00:21:22.650 --> 00:21:25.930
I've been placing decoy raiments all over town.

00:21:26.710 --> 00:21:29.430
The real Nora is currently watching Ayumi.

00:21:29.920 --> 00:21:32.180
And these raiments are for you.

00:21:32.960 --> 00:21:35.220
You can make yourself invisible 
while you move around.

00:21:38.650 --> 00:21:39.900
Good.

00:21:39.900 --> 00:21:43.020
I'll go back to placing decoys.

00:21:43.020 --> 00:21:44.240
Adieu!

00:21:45.290 --> 00:21:47.480
Okay, let's get going.

00:21:47.480 --> 00:21:49.310
Ayumi's headed for the ocean.

00:21:49.310 --> 00:21:50.440
Where are you going?

00:21:57.130 --> 00:21:58.900
Katsuragi, get a move on.

00:22:00.130 --> 00:22:02.670
I'll handle her.

00:22:04.030 --> 00:22:05.300
Understood.

00:22:05.300 --> 00:22:06.080
Let's go.

00:22:07.550 --> 00:22:09.680
You have to protect Chihiro and Ayumi.

00:22:21.150 --> 00:22:24.380
Katsuragi, why do you 
need to put on an act?

00:22:24.380 --> 00:22:27.320
Just say the words Ayumi wants to hear!

00:24:16.820 --> 00:24:19.410
I can see the ending.

00:24:16.990 --> 00:34:19.410
<b>The Memory of My First Love</b>
